config DILEMMA_LAYER_RGB
    bool "Color the underglow by active layer"
    default y
    depends on ZMK_RGB_UNDERGLOW && ZMK_SPLIT_ROLE_CENTRAL
    help
      Sets the underglow to a solid per-layer color on every layer change.
      Central only: the rgb_ug behavior's global locality forwards each
      change to the peripheral, so both halves stay in step.
